        "order": 1,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-01\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-01\"><h2>Ⅰ 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>この大問の全体像</strong><p>I-Aの1粒子の弾性散乱を壁面到達の幾何へつなぎ、I-Bで多数粒子の個数分布へ拡張する。I-Cでは面積速度と力学的エネルギーを軸に、有効ポテンシャルから双曲線軌道の散乱角まで追う。</p></aside><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>解くときの順序</strong><p>衝突の法線・接線成分を固定する → 壁へ届く角度条件を図で確認する → 粒子数は断面積×速さ×数密度で数える → 天体運動ではEとSを保存量として先に書き、有効ポテンシャルを平方完成する。</p></aside><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>Ⅰ-A</dt><dd>1 v／2 π−2θ_A／3 2mv cosθ_A／4 √2/2／5 L+R cosθ_A／6 (√3/2)R／7 √3(R+L)</dd></div><div><dt>Ⅰ-B</dt><dd>8 πR²vn／9 (1/2)πR²vn／10 (1/4)πR²vn</dd></div><div><dt>Ⅰ-C</dt><dd>11 −GMm/r／12 (1/2)rv sinφ／13 (1/2)v₀b／14 4S²/(GM)／15 (GM/(2S))²／16 1/r₁／17 π/2−β/2／18 4S</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>Ⅰ-A</h3></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>1.</h3><p class=\"prose\">条件より弾性衝突なので、力学的エネルギーは保存される。つまり、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"|\\vec v_A|=v\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> である。</p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>2.</h3><p class=\"prose\">入射角＝反射角なので、右図で</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-6bc54f13bea5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">2.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"2\\theta_A+\\alpha=\\pi\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-6bc54f13bea5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">2.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\alpha=\\pi-2\\theta_A\\qquad\\cdots\\cdots\\text{①}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"a-i-a-q2-collision\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-physics/figures/a-i-a-q2-collision.svg\" alt=\"接平面で接線成分は変わらず、法線成分は−v cosθAからv cosθAへ反転する。二つの角θAと反射方向の角αが一直線を分ける。\" width=\"660\" height=\"435\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>弾性衝突：法線・接線方向に分ける</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>3.</h3><p class=\"prose\">力積＝運動量変化なので、衝突面に平行な速度成分は変化しないことに注意して、力積の大きさを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"I\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-267c23695b6e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">3.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}I&amp;=|mv\\cos\\theta_A-(-mv\\cos\\theta_A)|\\\\&amp;=2mv\\cos\\theta_A\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>4.</h3><p class=\"prose\">右図より、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"R\\sin45^\\circ\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を超えると壁に到達するので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-23f663630e2f\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">4.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"R\\sin45^\\circ&lt;a\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-23f663630e2f\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">4.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}R&lt;a\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"a-i-a-q4-wall-condition\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-physics/figures/a-i-a-q4-wall-condition.svg\" alt=\"入射距離a=R/√2では反射速度が鉛直となり、右側の壁に届かない。これより大きくR未満の距離から衝突した小球のみ右へ進む。\" width=\"680\" height=\"495\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>壁に到達する条件の境界</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>5.</h3><p class=\"prose\">求める距離BCは下図より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-540dd397b2d3\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">5.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\mathrm{BC}=\\mathrm{BQ}+\\mathrm{QC}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-540dd397b2d3\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">5.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"=R\\sin\\theta_A+(\\mathrm{QB}+\\mathrm{AP})\\tan\\alpha\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-540dd397b2d3\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">5.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;=R\\sin\\theta_A\\\\&amp;\\quad +(L+R\\cos\\theta_A)\\tan\\alpha\\qquad\\text{②}\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">ただし、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\alpha\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は①である。</p><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"a-i-a-q5-wall-distance\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-physics/figures/a-i-a-q5-wall-distance.svg\" alt=\"PはAからy軸へ下ろした水平線の足、Qはその水平線と壁の交点。BQ=R sinθA、AQ=OB+AP=L+R cosθA、BC=BQ+QC。\" width=\"680\" height=\"480\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>壁までの水平距離と高さを分ける</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>6.</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\alpha=\\frac\\pi3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> のとき、①より <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\theta_A=\\frac\\pi3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> なので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-d80edd7fb074\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">6.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"a=R\\sin\\frac\\pi3=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}R\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>7.</h3><p class=\"prose\">②より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-a50aa8b9a980\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">7.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{BC}=R_1&amp;=R\\sin\\frac\\pi3\\\\&amp;\\quad+\\left(L+R\\cos\\frac\\pi3\\right)\\tan\\frac\\pi3\\\\&amp;=\\sqrt3(R+L)\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>Ⅰ-B</h3></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>8.</h3><p class=\"prose\">単位時間に小球は距離 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v\\cdot1=v\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> だけ進むので、球に衝突する小球は右図の斜線部の小球で、その数は半径 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"R\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、高さ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の円筒内の小球の数に等しい。よって</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-6ce012fd1056\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">8.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\pi R^2\\times v\\times n=\\pi R^2vn\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">となる。</p><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"a-i-b-q8-cylinder\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-physics/figures/a-i-b-q8-cylinder.svg\" alt=\"時間Δtに球へ入る粒子を数えるための円柱。半径R、長さvΔt、数密度n。体積にnを掛ければπR²vnΔt個となる。\" width=\"700\" height=\"450\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>衝突個数：断面積 × 通過距離 × 数密度</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>9.</h3><p class=\"prose\">4.より <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a&gt;\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}R\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> のとき壁に到達するので、上図の円筒内の斜線部に含まれる小球が衝突後、壁に到達する。斜線部の体積を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\Delta V\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-99a1b84b9865\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">9.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\Delta V&amp;=\\left\\{R^2-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}R\\right)^2\\right\\}\\\\&amp;\\quad\\times\\pi v\\Delta t\\\\&amp;=\\frac12\\pi R^2v\\Delta t\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">よって、その個数は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-99a1b84b9865\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">9.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"n\\Delta V=\\frac12\\pi R^2vn\\times\\Delta t\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>10.</h3><p class=\"prose\">半径 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"R_1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の壁上の円内に到達する小球は、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 軸からの距離が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}R\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> から <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"R\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> までの間の小球なので、その体積は下図の部分を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\Delta V&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-e3b7e7a038be\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">10.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\Delta V&#39;&amp;=\\left\\{R^2-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}R\\right)^2\\right\\}\\\\&amp;\\quad\\times\\pi v\\Delta t\\\\&amp;=\\frac14\\pi R^2v\\Delta t\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">よって、その個数は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-e3b7e7a038be\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">10.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"n\\Delta V&#39;=\\frac14\\pi R^2vn\\times\\Delta t\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">となる。</p><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"a-i-b-q9-q10-arrivals\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-physics/figures/a-i-b-q9-q10-arrivals.svg\" alt=\"入射断面をa=R/√2、a=√3R/2、a=Rで区分。内側は壁に届かず、中間の環は壁上の半径R1の外、外側の環は半径RとR1の間へ届く。a&gt;Rは未衝突なので数えない。\" width=\"650\" height=\"635\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>入射側の環状領域と壁上の到達範囲</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>Ⅰ-C</h3></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>11.</h3><p class=\"prose\">物体の力学的エネルギーは</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-5bc524c305cc\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">11.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"E=\\left(-G\\frac{mM}{r}\\right)+\\frac12mv^2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>12.</h3><p class=\"prose\">物体が、下図の位置のとき単位時間に <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 進むので、求める面積は図中</p><p class=\"prose\">の網かけ部分の三角形の面積に等しく</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-25602777cecc\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">12.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"S=\\frac12\\times r\\times v\\sin\\phi=\\frac12rv\\sin\\phi\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"a-i-c-q12-area\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-physics/figures/a-i-c-q12-area.svg\" alt=\"十分短い時間ΔtにPから接線方向へvΔt進む近似図。Oからの距離rに垂直な移動成分はvΔt sinϕ。微小面積をΔtで割る極限が面積速度S。\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>微小三角形から面積速度を求める</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>13.</h3><p class=\"prose\">物体が遠方で <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> のときは、上図のように角 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\phi_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> をとると <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sin\\phi_0=\\frac{b}{r_1}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-352e15aaca7d\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">13.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}S&amp;=\\frac12r_1v_0\\sin\\phi_0\\\\&amp;=\\frac12r_1v_0\\frac{b}{r_1}\\\\&amp;=\\frac12v_0b\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>14.</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v^2=v_r^2+(v\\sin\\phi)^2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、12.より <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v\\sin\\phi=\\frac{2S}{r}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> であるから</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-45d873d4bfdc\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">14.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}E={}&amp;-G\\frac{mM}{r}\\\\&amp;+\\frac12m\\left\\{v_r^2+\\left(\\frac{2S}{r}\\right)^2\\right\\}\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-45d873d4bfdc\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">14.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;=-G\\frac{mM}{r}+2m\\left(\\frac{S}{r}\\right)^2\\\\&amp;\\quad+\\frac12mv_r^2\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">なので、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V(r)\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は次のようになる。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-45d873d4bfdc\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">14.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V(r)=-G\\frac{mM}{r}+2m\\left(\\frac{S}{r}\\right)^2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-45d873d4bfdc\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">14.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;=2mS^2\\left(\\frac1r-\\frac{GM}{4S^2}\\right)^2\\\\&amp;\\quad-\\frac{mG^2M^2}{8S^2}\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">よって</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-45d873d4bfdc\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">14.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\frac1{r_1}&amp;=\\frac{GM}{4S^2}\\\\\\therefore\\quad r_1&amp;=\\frac{4S^2}{GM}\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-45d873d4bfdc\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">14.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V(r_1)=-\\frac{mG^2M^2}{8S^2}\\ \\text{とわかる。}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>15.</h3><p class=\"prose\">十分遠方と <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"r=r_1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> での力学的エネルギー保存則より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-205812a9ce3f\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">15.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12mv_0^2=\\frac12mv_{r1}^2+V(r_1)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">ここで、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac12mv_0^2=E\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V(r_1)=-\\frac{mG^2M^2}{8S^2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-205812a9ce3f\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">15.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"E=\\frac12mv_{r1}^2-\\frac{mG^2M^2}{8S^2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_{r1}&gt;0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-205812a9ce3f\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">15.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v_{r1}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2E}{m}+\\left(\\frac{GM}{2S}\\right)^2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>16.</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"r=r_1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> と <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_r=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となる位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"r_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> との間で力学的エネルギー保存則は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-3ec1d1e80d46\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">16.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12mv_{r1}^2+V(r_1)=\\frac12m\\cdot0^2+V(r_2)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-3ec1d1e80d46\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">16.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\frac12mv_{r1}^2-\\frac{mG^2M^2}{8S^2}&amp;=2mS^2\\left(u_2-\\frac1{r_1}\\right)^2\\\\&amp;\\quad-\\frac{mG^2M^2}{8S^2}\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"u_2&gt;0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-3ec1d1e80d46\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">16.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"u_2=\\frac1{r_1}+\\frac{v_{r1}}{2S}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>17.</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\theta_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> と <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\beta\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は下図のようになるので、直線2で、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2\\theta_2+\\beta=\\pi\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の関係が成り立つ。よって</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-264c32868d21\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">17.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\theta_2=\\frac\\pi2-\\frac\\beta2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"a-i-c-q17-symmetry\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-physics/figures/a-i-c-q17-symmetry.svg\" alt=\"入射・出射漸近線は直線2に関して鏡映対称。Kに集まる角から2θ2+β=πとなる。FはKと同じ高さ、Hは出射漸近線と平面の交点。\" width=\"660\" height=\"510\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>対称性から θ₂ と β を対応させる</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>18.</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"r\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> と <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\theta\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の関係は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-7b2d3fe05317\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">18.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}r={}&amp;\\left\\{\\frac1{r_1}\\right.\\\\&amp;\\left.+\\left(\\frac{v_{r1}}{2S}\\right)\\cos(\\theta-\\theta_2)\\right\\}^{-1}\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"r\\to\\infty\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> のとき、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\theta=\\pi\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> で右辺の分母を0とおくと</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-7b2d3fe05317\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">18.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\frac1{r_1}&amp;+\\left(\\frac{v_{r1}}{2S}\\right)\\\\&amp;\\quad\\times\\cos(\\pi-\\theta_2)=0\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-7b2d3fe05317\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">18.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac1{r_1}=\\left(\\frac{v_{r1}}{2S}\\right)\\cos\\theta_2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">ここで、17.の結果より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-7b2d3fe05317\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">18.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\cos\\theta_2&amp;=\\cos\\left(\\frac\\pi2-\\frac\\beta2\\right)\\\\&amp;=\\sin\\frac\\beta2\\simeq\\frac\\beta2\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">なので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-7b2d3fe05317\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">18.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\frac1{r_1}&amp;\\simeq\\left(\\frac{v_{r1}}{2S}\\right)\\frac\\beta2\\\\\\therefore\\quad\\beta&amp;\\simeq\\frac{4S}{v_{r1}r_1}\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">の関係が成り立つ。よって、前ページの図より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-7b2d3fe05317\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">18.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\mathrm{FH}}{\\mathrm{FK}}&amp;=\\tan\\beta\\simeq\\beta\\\\&amp;=\\frac1{v_{r1}}\\times4S\\times\\frac1{r_1}\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-02",
        "label": "Ⅱ",
        "order": 2,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-02\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-02\"><h2>Ⅱ 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>この大問の全体像</strong><p>電池接続中の誘電体挿入で一定の量と変化する量を整理し、分極の遅れをRC並列等価回路として扱う。電流ベクトルの位相差から等価抵抗を決め、実効値を使って各抵抗の平均電力を求める。</p></aside><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>解くときの順序</strong><p>II-Aで電位差一定を確認する → II-Bで抵抗電流と容量性電流を別々に書く → ベクトル図からtanδを作る → 平均電力では電圧振幅を√2で割って実効値へ直す → II-Cは抵抗ごとの電力を足しても合成抵抗を使ってもよい。</p></aside><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>Ⅱ-A</dt><dd>1 V／2 ε₀S／3 1／4 εᵣ／5 εᵣ／ア 誘電／イ 電場</dd></div><div><dt>Ⅱ-B</dt><dd>6 V₀/R／7 RCωδ／8 1/(Cωδ tanδ)／9 (V₀²/2)Cωδ tanδ</dd></div><div><dt>Ⅱ-C</dt><dd>10 1/(2r)／11 (1+Cωδ r tanδ)/(2r)</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>Ⅱ-A</h3></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>1.</h3><p class=\"prose\">電場の強さは</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c977dbe78522\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">1.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"E_0=\\frac{V}{d}=\\frac1d\\times V\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>2.</h3><p class=\"prose\">電気容量は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-6bc54f13bea5\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">2.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"C_0=\\varepsilon_0\\frac{S}{d}=\\frac1d\\times\\varepsilon_0S\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>ア.</h3><p class=\"prose\">電場中に誘電体を入れると、誘電分極により誘電体の表面に電荷が現れる。</p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>イ.</h3><p class=\"prose\">誘電分極によりコンデンサー内の電場は弱められる。</p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>3.</h3><p class=\"prose\">電場の強さは1.で定義されそのまま変わらない。つまり、1倍である。</p><p class=\"prose\">極板間の電位差 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> が一定であることに注意する。</p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>4.</h3><p class=\"prose\">電気量を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"Q\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと、初めの電気量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"Q_0=C_0V\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> なので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-23f663630e2f\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">4.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"Q=CV=\\varepsilon_rC_0V=\\varepsilon_rQ_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>5.</h3><p class=\"prose\">電気容量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"C\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-540dd397b2d3\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">5.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}C&amp;=\\varepsilon_rC_0=\\varepsilon_r\\varepsilon_0\\frac{S}{d}\\\\&amp;=\\frac1d\\times\\varepsilon_0S\\times\\varepsilon_r\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">となる。</p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>Ⅱ-B</h3></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>6.</h3><p class=\"prose\">交流電圧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V=V_0\\sin\\omega t\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> のとき、右図の等価回路で電流 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"I_R\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-d80edd7fb074\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">6.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"I_R=\\frac VR=\\frac{V_0}{R}\\sin\\omega t\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">よって、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\vec I_R\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の大きさは <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{V_0}{R}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> である。</p><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"a-ii-b-q6-equivalent\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-physics/figures/a-ii-b-q6-equivalent.svg\" alt=\"同じa,b端子間に理想容量Cと損失抵抗Rを並列接続。電流ICとIRはa側からb側へ流れ、供給電流Iはその和。\" width=\"640\" height=\"520\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>損失抵抗 R と理想容量 C の並列等価回路</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>7.</h3><p class=\"prose\">同様に、コンデンサーのリアクタンスは <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac1{C\\omega_\\delta}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> なので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-a50aa8b9a980\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">7.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}I_C&amp;=\\frac{V}{1/(C\\omega_\\delta)}\\\\&amp;=V_0C\\omega_\\delta\\sin\\left(\\omega_\\delta t+\\frac\\pi2\\right)\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">よって、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\vec I_C\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の大きさは <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{V_0}{R}\\times RC\\omega_\\delta\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> である。</p><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"a-ii-b-q7-phasor\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-physics/figures/a-ii-b-q7-phasor.svg\" alt=\"電圧Vを横方向の基準とする。抵抗電流IRはVと同相、容量電流ICは90度進む。I=IC+IRで、ICからIへの遅れがδ。\" width=\"640\" height=\"525\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>電流の直交成分と位相の遅れ δ（拡大）</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>8.</h3><p class=\"prose\">右上図の位相のずれより</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-6ce012fd1056\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">8.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\tan\\delta&amp;=\\frac{V_0/R}{V_0C\\omega_\\delta}\\\\&amp;=\\frac1{RC\\omega_\\delta}\\\\\\therefore\\quad R&amp;=\\frac1{C\\omega_\\delta\\tan\\delta}\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>9.</h3><p class=\"prose\">抵抗での電力の時間平均 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\overline P\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-99a1b84b9865\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">9.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\overline P&amp;=R\\left(\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\frac{V_0}{R}\\right)^2\\\\&amp;=\\frac{V_0^2}{2R}\\\\&amp;=\\frac{V_0^2}{2}C\\omega_\\delta\\tan\\delta\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>Ⅱ-C</h3></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>10.</h3><p class=\"prose\">与えられた回路の等価回路は右図のようになる。抵抗 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"r\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> に流れる電流 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"I_r\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-e3b7e7a038be\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">10.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"I_r=\\frac Vr=\\frac{V_0}{r}\\sin\\omega t\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">なので</p><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"a-ii-c-q10-circuit\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-physics/figures/a-ii-c-q10-circuit.svg\" alt=\"a,b端子間へ理想容量C、誘電損失抵抗R、追加抵抗rをすべて並列に接続。電力はRとrで消費され、理想容量Cの周期平均消費電力は0。\" width=\"640\" height=\"520\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>実コンデンサーを C と R に分け、r を加える</figcaption></figure><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-e3b7e7a038be\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">10.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\overline{P_r}&amp;=r\\left(\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\frac{V_0}{r}\\right)^2\\\\&amp;=V_0^2\\times\\frac1{2r}\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>11.</h3><p class=\"prose\">2つの抵抗の合成抵抗を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"R&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-5bc524c305cc\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">11.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\frac1{R&#39;}&amp;=\\frac1R+\\frac1r\\\\R&#39;&amp;=\\frac{Rr}{R+r}\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"R&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を流れる電流を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"I&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-5bc524c305cc\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">11.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}I&#39;&amp;=\\frac V{R&#39;}=\\frac{V_0}{R&#39;}\\sin\\omega t\\\\&amp;=\\frac{V_0(R+r)}{Rr}\\sin\\omega t\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">なので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-5bc524c305cc\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">11.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\overline{P_t}&amp;=R&#39;\\left(\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\frac{V_0}{R&#39;}\\right)^2\\\\&amp;=V_0^2\\times\\frac1{2R&#39;}\\\\&amp;=V_0^2\\times\\frac{R+r}{2Rr}\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">ここで、8.の結果を代入すると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-5bc524c305cc\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">11.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\overline{P_t}&amp;=V_0^2\\frac{\\frac1{C\\omega_\\delta\\tan\\delta}+r}{\\frac{2r}{C\\omega_\\delta\\tan\\delta}}\\\\&amp;=V_0^2\\times\\frac{1+C\\omega_\\delta r\\tan\\delta}{2r}\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>別解</strong><p>平行板コンデンサーで消費される電力の時間平均は0であるので、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\overline{P_t}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は抵抗器で消費される電力平均の合計 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\overline P+\\overline{P_r}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となる。9.と10.より</p></aside><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-5bc524c305cc\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">11.</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\overline{P_t}&amp;=\\overline P+\\overline{P_r}\\\\&amp;=\\frac{V_0^2}{2}C\\omega_\\delta\\tan\\delta+\\frac{V_0^2}{2r}\\\\&amp;=V_0^2\\times\\frac{1+C\\omega_\\delta r\\tan\\delta}{2r}\\end{aligned}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      }
    ]
  },
